WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.360
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.790
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.390
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
Episode 12

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.400
Ru Yue

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.600
Ma…master

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.400
Have you finished the mission?

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:04.400
Master, I failed

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:09.130
Did they have a better Cultivation Base than you?

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.130
or

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.200
did you not take the mission to heart at all?

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:18.930
Neither

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.860
I’ll explain for you

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.800
You already colluded with them

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.530
and plan to kill me, right?

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:35.660
That’s not true, I wouldn't dare betray you

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.060
Everything is under my observation

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.200
Do you remember that uncle who was cleaning up the school?

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.130
You…you secretly disguised yourself

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:57.200
It can be more convenient to suck some students that way,

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:01.400
And sometimes I learn of something unexpected

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:05.060
Such as you betraying me

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.000
Old devil

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:15.400
I’ll indulge you in this game of chase

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.330
and finally reach a perfect end to our teacher and pupil relationship

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:28.660
You bought this dagger

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.600
Yes, Ling Er chose it for me

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.000
This is a sealed spirit weapon

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.660
A Real Dragon Soul was sealed inside it

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.000
It is said that a senior killed a red dragon that was bringing disaster

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.460
as it walked the world,

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.000
and he sealed its soul into this dagger

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:57.930
The Real Dragon blood on the dagger is extremely corrosive

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.860
A real Dragon soul? Real Dragon blood?

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.400
You seem to be very familiar with the history of this dagger

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:12.530
Yes, I've existed in the world for a long time so I've heard of it before

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:20.130
Master, it was actually Li Xuanzi who killed the dragon

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:22.660
So that's how it is.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.530
I really got a valuable dagger

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:31.330
Let’s see what happens after I release the Real Dragon to bite that old monster

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.660
The Real Dragon is a yaoguai beast

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.600
Most yaoguai beasts are hostile to humans

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.000
If master really does release it…

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:45.060
I’m afraid that it will only cause more trouble

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:49.530
And I don’t know how to release it

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.730
Then it makes no difference whether or not we possess it

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.030
Awkward…

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.400
No, after all the dagger is still a magical treasure

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.130
So it must have some special technique

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.400
Master can try putting spirit energy in it and see what happens

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.460
Let me try

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.660
Body Separation!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:28.060
Just this ordinary technique?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.800
I don’t think it is, these three bodies

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.460
I can't tell which is real even though I have such a good cultivation base

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.170
It’s so amazing, right?

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.710
By the way, you can use use spirit energy freely now?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.110
It’s all because of Ling Er’s help

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.840
That old monster knows everything and wants to kill us, converge at the designated location

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.240
Ru Yue started the plan, we need to go

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.640
Yingxiong, do you really want to do this?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.640
To fight that old guy...

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.770
Of course

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:09.240
Put this on

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:17.710
Promise me, no matter what happens, stay alive

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:31.710
Muzi, no matter what happens, I will protect you

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.040
Master

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.710
Old devil, you've planned to kill me for a long time, haven't you?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:47.570
Correct, your intelligence is enough to allow you to reach Core Formation.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:52.440
If that happens, I won't be able to control you at all

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.710
You must have planned to do this back when you took me as an apprentice

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:06.440
So what? Now that things have gotten this far, there's no need to lie

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.510
Starting from the moment I saw your intelligence

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.770
you were definitely the invigoration I planned to raise for 16 years to

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:17.840
help me to reach Late Stage of Core Formation

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.640
Damn it

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.570
He's in Core Formation, we can’t defeat him straight up

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:28.840
We need to try to find a way to use the Array, it’s our key to wining

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.840
I hope we succeed

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:41.310
I don’t know why, but I have a bad feeling

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:47.710
No

00:07:54.970 --> 00:08:01.770
My dear disciple, just give up, you will only make me more excited if you continue struggling

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:06.770
Now that I can’t escape, I’ll try my best to fight with you till the last moment, maybe I'll have the slightest chance

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:14.770
You have no chance, now come and give me you spirit energy

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.640
Look over here

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:32.710
Yingxiong

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:42.170
Body Separation, little kid

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.240
This isn’t ordinary Body Separation

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:50.110
It doesn’t make sense, now that you are here

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:56.240
I’ll kill you all, bloody palm

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.510
Ru Yue, Muzi, let’s attack together, I can't always rely on you to save me

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.840
The old devil’s cover is too strong, we need to find its weaknesses

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.370
We attack together

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:51.370
I am slightly amused by your struggle

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.970
Flame Fist

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:03.240
You silly ants, you know nothing about the power of Core Formation

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.040
Li fire

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.370
Here

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:21.170
Your skill is insignificant

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:28.770
Core Formation’s spirit energy is so powerful, but there is Real Dragon blood on this dagger

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.840
Maybe it can break his cover

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:32.170
Let’s gamble

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.840
Your action ends now, just lay down and die

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.040
This is my chance

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:47.040
Old devil, we won’t simply wait for death

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.040
Sword in fist

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:02.440
Piss off

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.170
Yingxiong, is that?

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:14.570
It worked

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:19.770
Old devil, accept your death

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:29.670
It's the whisper of waves
Waken at nightfall

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:35.470
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:43.810
Blank mood
Scattered time

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:48.540
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:56.870
Ear is listening
Wind is passed

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:02.410
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:10.410
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:17.210
Bit bit drops into my heart
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:17.260
Bit bit drops into my heart

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:24.250
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:29.390
It rejects of dying alone
